repository-code: "https://github.com/cmngtny5bw-collab/1808-eruption-search"
url: "https://williamsuk.ai"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A literature review and archival search for the unidentified tropical
  eruption whose sulfate appears in polar ice dated to 1809. The repository
  holds a source register, one notes file per research strand, a findings
  table with a verification level on every row, derived data tables and the
  scripts that made them. Much of the text was written by an AI model
  (Claude) working for the maintainer and is marked as such. Scripts are MIT;
  files in data/cc-by-sa/ are CC BY-SA 4.0.
keywords:
  - "1809 eruption"
  - "volcanic sulfate"
  - "historical climatology"
  - "archival research"
  - "ice cores"
  - "human-AI collaboration"
